cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use greek-conversion in research or in a published resource, please
  cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: greek-conversion
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript library that converts Ancient and Modern Greek between Greek
  script, Beta Code, and Latin script, with standards-based presets and
  information-loss diagnostics. Each preset implements a published convention
  (ALA-LC, BnF, ISO 843 and ELOT 743, SBL, TLG, Perseus) as a set of atomic
  conversion options.
authors:
  - family-names: Boquet
    given-names: Antoine
version: 1.0.0-rc.12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/defense-humanites/greek-conversion"
url: "https://greek-conversion.humanites.fr/"
keywords:
  - Ancient Greek
  - Modern Greek
  - Byzantine Greek
  - Medieval Greek
  - polytonic Greek
  - Beta Code
  - transliteration
  - romanization
  - digital humanities
